========================================================================
C1  chain rule  d/dt[lam*U(lam*x)] = lamdot*(U + y U'),  y = lam*x
   U = exp(-Y**2/2)  ->  difference = 0
   U = Y**3 - Y  ->  difference = 0
   U = cos(Y)  ->  difference = 0
   lamdot / lam^3 = a (must be a)

========================================================================
C2  exponent bookkeeping  lam^(3-3/q) = (2a(T-t))^(-(3/2)(1-1/q))
   log-difference = 0 (must be 0)

========================================================================
C3  Kato-type inequality  Delta|w|^p - p|w|^(p-2) w Delta w = p(p-1)|w|^(p-2)|grad w|^2
   p=2: residual = 0 (must be 0)
   p=4: residual = 0 (must be 0)

========================================================================
C4  Prodi-Serrin / Young exponents
   1/q + (q-2)/(2q) + 1/2      = 1
   (1-3/q)*(2q/(q-3))          = 2
   1/sigma + 1/sigma' , sigma=2q/(q+3), sigma'=2q/(q-3)  = 1

========================================================================
C5  vorticity of the Gaussian profile used in Cor. 7.3 / Thm 8.1
   curl u = (-x**2 - y**2 + 2)*exp(-x**2/2 - y**2/2)  (should be (2 - r^2) exp(-r^2/2))
   check  : 0

========================================================================
C6  2D vorticity identity  (u.grad)w = curl((u.grad)u)  for div-free u
   div u = 0
   (u.grad)w - curl((u.grad)u) = 0
